        else:
          say: Your seal falters and breaks, and takes most of you with it. The door stays ajar. The last thing you see is the headmistress's lantern coming down the tunnel.
> bargain: Accept the Star's bargain
  hint: Power beyond measure. A voice in your head forever. Only for those it has already tempted.
  when: alignment <= -30 or flag(hollow_tempted)
  flag hollow_bargain
  alignment -large
  arcana +huge
  gain star_mark
  health -large
  lose hollow_dreams
  if alignment <= -30:
    mood +medium
    say: You take what it offers, and it feels like coming home. The door closes on its own, for now. The Star settles into the back of your mind like a cat finding a warm lap. The price comes out of your body: you climb the tunnel grey-lipped, and for days every stair leaves you breathless.
  else:
    mood -large
    say: You take what it offers. The door closes on its own, for now. The Star settles into the back of your mind like a cat finding a warm lap. You climb the tunnel grey-lipped, and for a week you lie awake, too weak for stairs.
> open: Open the door
  hint: It wants out. Only one already deep in the Hollow could walk through beside it.
  when: alignment <= -60 or flag(hollow_tempted)
  if alignment <= -60:
    flag hollow_freed
    alignment -large
    arcana +large
    gain star_mark
    lose hollow_dreams
    renown -medium
    say: You set your palm on the black stone and push. The door swings wide. The Star rises past you like a breath held for three hundred years, and on its way out it touches your shoulder, the way a lord touches a sword. Above, every candle in Lumenhold goes out, and does not come back on until dawn.
  else:
    end ending_hollow_claimed
> flee: Run
  health -large
  mood -large
  flag hollow_fled
  say: You run until the tunnel spits you out onto the shore. Behind you, the door is still ajar. In the morning, the headmistress's hair has gone white.

@event hs_aftermath
title: After the Thaw
class: story
tone: eerie
trigger: queued
art: sun
tags: hollowstar story
chain: hollowstar
scene: The lake glittering in spring sunshine, students skimming stones, a bandaged figure sitting on the jetty.
text: The lake glitters as if nothing happened. Most of the academy believes there was a strange spring frost. The headmistress knows better. So does Kael, who finds you on the jetty with two cups of tea.
> left: Sit with him in silence
  rel kael +large
  mood +medium
  say: You watch the water. It's just water, now. Kael's tea, for once, doesn't freeze.
> right: Tell him how you feel
  if spark(kael) >= 25:
    spark kael +large
    bond kael partner
    say: He kisses you, and for the first time since you've known him, his hands are warm.
  else:
    rel kael +large
    if bond(kael) == "none":
      bond kael close
    say: "I owe you everything," he says. "I'm not good at owing people. I'll learn."

@event hs_aftermath_lost
title: The Headmistress Closed It
class: story
tone: grim
trigger: queued
actor: isolde
art: door
tags: hollowstar story
chain: hollowstar
scene: An infirmary bed by a window, the lake thawed outside, a tall woman with newly white hair sitting beside it without her silver ring.
text: You wake in the infirmary. The lake has thawed, and the door is shut: the headmistress came down after you and closed it with her own hands. She is sitting by your bed. Her hair has gone white overnight, and her silver ring is gone.
> left: "I'm sorry."
  meet isolde
  rel isolde +medium
  mood -medium
  say: "You went down," she says. "Most don't. The door is shut, and I am old, and that was always the price for someone." She pats your hand once, like a chess move. You can't stop thinking about it for weeks.
> right: "What did it cost you?"
  meet isolde
  lore +small
  mood -large
  say: She tells you, plainly, and you wish she hadn't. The seal will hold for another lifetime. She won't. She asks you not to tell the others, and you don't, and it weighs on you.

@event hs_kael_sister
title: The Sister
class: story
tone: eerie
when: flag(kael_ally) and turn >= 22 and not flag(met_sister)
weight: 10
art: snow
tags: mystery hollowstar
chain: hollowstar
scene: A girl in white furs standing at the academy gates in a snowstorm that is falling only on her.
text: A girl in white furs is waiting at the gates in a private snowstorm. Kael's younger sister, Ilse. "If my brother won't open it," she says, "I will. Unless you can give me a reason not to."
> left: Convince her
  flag met_sister
  find ilse_truth
  challenge negotiate journeyman:
    win:
      rel kael +large
      say: You talk for an hour. Then she's crying, and Kael is holding her, and the snow stops. She stays in the village to be near him.
    lose:
      mood -small
      say: She listens politely and leaves. "We'll see each other again," she says. "Beneath the water."
> right: Warn the headmistress
  flag met_sister
  find ilse_truth
  rel isolde +small
  rel kael -small
  say: Ilse is escorted from the grounds. Kael understands. He says he understands. He's quiet for a long time.
